37057>>>>>    Function SetUserPassword String sLoginName String sPassword Returns Boolean
37059>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37059>>>>>        Integer iErr
37059>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37060>>>>>        
37060>>>>>        //  Find the user
