37091>>>>>    
37091>>>>>    //
37091>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37091>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37091>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37091>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37091>>>>>    //
37091>>>>>    // Params:
37091>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37091>>>>>    //
37091>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37093>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37093>>>>>        
37093>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37094>>>>>        
37094>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37094>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37096>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37097>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37098>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37099>>>>>            
37099>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37100>>>>>        End
37100>>>>>>
37100>>>>>        Else Begin
37101>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37102>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37103>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37104>>>>>            
37104>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37105>>>>>        End
37105>>>>>>
37105>>>>>    End_Procedure
37106>>>>>    
37106>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37108>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37108>>>>>    End_Procedure
37109>>>>>    
37109>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37111>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37111>>>>>    End_Procedure
37112>>>>>    
37112>>>>>    Procedure EndSession
37114>>>>>        Integer iErr
37114>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession
37114>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
37114>>>>>        
37114>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37115>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37116>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37118>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37120>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37121>>>>>        End
37121>>>>>>
37121>>>>>            
37121>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37121>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37122>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37123>>>>>        
37123>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37124>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37126>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37127>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37128>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37130>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37130>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37131>>>>>>
37131>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37132>>>>>            End
37132>>>>>>
37132>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37133>>>>>        End
37133>>>>>>
37133>>>>>    End_Procedure
37134>>>>>
37134>>>>>End_Class
37135>>>>>
